# MyMicroAI

**MyMicroAI** is an ambitious pocket AI terminal for the Waveshare ESP32-S3 CAM Touch LCD 2.1: a tiny touch-first device that brings text chat, camera capture, SD-card memory, and OpenAI-compatible multimodal AI into one self-contained firmware.

It is built as a real embedded product prototype rather than a simple demo: polished UI, onboard setup wizard, persistent chat sessions, multilingual keyboard, camera preview, photo attachments, and careful PSRAM/SD-card handling for constrained hardware.

